    "title": "Washington County residents share frustrations over impending tax levy increases - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WAMC Northeast Public Radio ,\n4 hours ago Facing the possibility of a 20% tax levy increase, Washington County residents showed up in droves to a Friday morning Board of Supervisors meeting. More than 200 people were watching Friday’s Washington County Board of Supervisor’s meeting online, and several hundred people showed up in person – enough so that four overflow rooms had to be opened in the county’s municipal building. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
